lict","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hisui is Masato and Ria's childhood friend. Previously very kind, very close to Masato and very passionate about stars, Hisui is now a true ice princess. Impossible to approach, close to no one and always isolated. Schoolwise, however, Hisui remains an excellent student, being ranked as the second best student in every subjects."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Some students think that her behaviour is the result of her anxiety about the responsibilities she is trapped in, she is the heir to a long line of \"heros\" of which the school principal is a member who used AD technologies, and that her position as \"Second\" shakes her a lot (even if the first is never the same in all subjects)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17125"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園長の孫娘として学園内では有名人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀で何でもそつなくこなすが、何事にも醒めたようなリアクションしか取らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも周囲から距離を置き、他人を寄せ付けないオーラを発している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「星を見るのは好きよ。夜空を眺めている間は、穏やかな気持ちになれるから」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"296","sourceWorkId":"18276","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園長の孫娘として学園内では有名人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀で何でもそつなくこなすが、何事にも醒めたようなリアクションしか取らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも周囲から距離を置き、他人を寄せ付けないオーラを発している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「星を見るのは好きよ。夜空を眺めている間は、穏やかな気持ちになれるから」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20182"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"83 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"296","sourceWorkId":"18276","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"c","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"296","so